The validities (\ref{validity:termRM1}), (\ref{validity:termRM2}) and  (\ref{validity:termRM3}) are of particular interest since they highlight
the interaction between counterfactual
conditionals, propositional atoms
and causal information. 
If $\preceq_\state$ were a total
preorder,
the formula  
\begin{align*}
\big( (\phi \boxRight \psi) \wedge (\phi \diamondRight \chi) \big) \rightarrow (\phi \wedge \chi) \boxRight \psi    
\end{align*}
