\section{Conclusion}
In this paper, we propose an ROI-aware generative image semantic communication system driven by latent features LRISC. Specifically, the system incorporates an adaptive ROI-guided feature encoding mechanism that intelligently allocates transmission rates, combined with a powerful diffusion model to achieve high-fidelity image reconstruction under limited bandwidth. Simulation results demonstrate that the system not only maintains robustness in semantic image transmission but also delivers superior perceptual quality across various channel conditions.

