\centering
\begin{tabular}{c c}
\hline
\textbf{Implementation} & \textbf{Mean Performance (s)}\\
\hline
Our Implementation & 0.0154 \\
Matlab & 0.0017 \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\caption{Timing performance for Matlab's and our implementation of Kruskal's algorithm on the random power factor IEEE-123 Node network. The mean of three runs was taken. }
