\item To mitigate the impact of PV power on voltage-magnitude based correlation analysis, we propose a time-based SM data selection strategy to extract voltage magnitude measurements primarily influenced by household loads (e.g., during night time or low-PV-output periods). The resulting datasets enhance topology correction accuracy, particularly in scenarios with noisy or incomplete datasets.
