\caption{\textnormal{A practical LVDN with multiple parallel feeders along the same street demonstrates the common challenge of ambiguous use-feeder connections and phase labelling, illustrating the physical complexity that makes accurate network topology identification (i.e., step (2) and (3)) difficult.}}
\vspace{-0.5cm}
