for any ordering. Note that when applied to a diagonal matrix, Jacobi
then reduces to bubble sort.

\begin{theorem}\label{thm:conv} If we require $\M{\hat{D}}_{11}\geq\M{\hat{D}}_{22}$
in line~7 of Algorithm~\ref{alg:Jacobi1}, then for any order in
