We distinguish between three scenarios:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item (\verb|lines 11-12|) If the source state $r$ of the transition does not yet belong to any procedure, the algorithm assigns a new register symbol $\alpha' \in \mathit{Id}(r)$ as a~test symbol. This symbol ensures that the procedure return transition can only be taken with equivalent register value.
