\textbf{Virus Colony Search (VCS)}: The Virus Colony Search (VCS) algorithm is based on the propagation and infection mechanisms of viruses. It uses these biological processes to explore and exploit the search space. By simulating how viruses spread and adapt, VCS aims to find optimal solutions through effective search strategies. \cite{vcs2015}

