\end{tcolorbox}

\vspace{2mm} % Added vertical space
In parallel, the ($\mathcal{G}_{\text{grad\_P\_PC}}$) agent refines the prompt $P_t$ based on the patient-focused answer gradient, aiming to improve the prompt's ability to elicit patient-relevant answers.

