Furthermore, the \textit{MIR transformation} involves optimization algorithms related to lifetimes, which can also introduce related issues.
Regarding \textit{error reporting} in both the HIR and MIR components, most bugs stem from general programming errors, especially improper error handling, which can misclassify the root causes of compilation failures.





