where $w_0$, $w_1$ and $w_2$ are defined in Equation \ref{m-m weight}, Equation \ref{eq:loss 1} and Equation \ref{weight-function}, and $WL_{m-m}$ refers to total HPWL of {\tt macro cluster-macro cluster} connections, $WL_{m-c}$ means HPWL of {\tt macro cluster-cell cluster} connections, $WL_{m-c-c}$ represents HPWL of the second-hop connection from {\tt macro cluster-cell cluster-cell cluster}. 

