Overall, the existing ASPR-related datasets remain predominantly confined to textual data, overlooking other multimodal elements, such as figures, images, and tables from the manuscripts. This lack of multimodal integration restricts the potential for developing multimodal LLMs for ASPR. Additionally, operational support for multimodal LLM-driven ASPR is still underdeveloped, restricting the practical application of these models in real-world scenarios.




